<div class="page-card">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
    <h2 class="section-title">Welcome to Pantry Community Portal</h2>
    <p>
        The Pantry Community Portal is a community-driven platform designed to connect people in need with local food and support services.
        Our mission is to make it easier for individuals and families facing hardship to find nearby food pantries, request assistance,
        and access essential community resources.
    </p>
    <p>
        At the same time, we empower organizations, charities, churches, community groups, and volunteers to register and manage their
        pantries, ensuring that support reaches those who need it most.
    </p>

    <h3 class="section-title">Our Mission</h3>
    <p>We believe that no one should struggle alone when help is available within their community.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Connect people with nearby food and community pantries.</li>
        <li>Simplify the process of requesting assistance.</li>
        <li>Support organizations that provide food and essential services.</li>
        <li>Strengthen communities through collaboration and accessibility.</li>
        <li>Reduce barriers between those offering help and those seeking support.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="section-title">What We Do</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>🏠 <strong>Find Local Pantries</strong> — Search by location, suburb, postcode, or city with map support.</li>
        <li>🤝 <strong>Request Assistance</strong> — Simple user-friendly request process to registered pantries.</li>
        <li>📍 <strong>Register a Pantry</strong> — Organizations can register to become visible to those in need.</li>
        <li>🌍 <strong>Build Stronger Communities</strong> — One platform connecting care providers and community members.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="section-title">Who We Serve</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Individuals and Families:</strong> Seeking food support and community resources.</li>
        <li><strong>Community Pantries:</strong> Distributing food and essential supplies.</li>
        <li><strong>Charities and Non-Profit Organizations:</strong> Reaching more people in need.</li>
        <li><strong>Volunteers and Community Leaders:</strong> Supporting local welfare initiatives.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="section-title">Our Vision</h3>
    <p>
        We envision a future where every person can easily find support during difficult times and where community organizations have the
        tools they need to serve their communities effectively.
    </p>
    <p>
        Through technology, collaboration, and compassion, we aim to create a connected support network that improves access to essential
        resources and strengthens community resilience.
    </p>

    <h3 class="section-title">Why Pantry Community Portal?</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>✔ Easy-to-use location-based pantry search</li>
        <li>✔ Simple assistance request process</li>
        <li>✔ Interactive mapping and community discovery</li>
        <li>✔ Support for registered community organizations</li>
        <li>✔ Secure and accessible platform</li>
        <li>✔ Built to strengthen local communities</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="section-title">Our Values</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Compassion:</strong> Supporting people with dignity, respect, and understanding.</li>
        <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Help should be easy to find and accessible to everyone.</li>
        <li><strong>Community:</strong> Strong communities are built when people support one another.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Clear communication between providers and community members.</li>
        <li><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Partnerships between organizations, volunteers, and communities.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="section-title">Join Our Community</h3>
    <p>
        Whether you are seeking support, managing a pantry, volunteering, or looking to make a difference, Pantry Community Portal is here
        to help connect communities and create positive change.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Together, we can ensure that support is accessible, communities are stronger, and no one is left behind.</strong></p>

    <h3 class="section-title">Contact Us</h3>
    <p>📧 Email: support@pantrycommunityportal.com</p>
    <p>🌐 Pantry Community Portal</p>
    <p><em>"Connecting Communities. Supporting Lives."</em></p>
</div>